<title>JAPAN: Key Dec JGB rises to all-time high of 125.73.</title>
<headline>Key Dec JGB rises to all-time high of 125.73.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The key December Japanese government bond (JGB) futures contract set an all-time high of 125.73 in early Tuesday trading on the Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE).</p>
<p>The level of 125.73 was the highest ever for any benchmark contract listed on the TSE.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
</text>
